  "operative_text": "Section 1 (R.C. 2923.11): (7) Any firearm with an overall length of at least twenty-six inches that is approved for sale by the federal bureau of alcohol, tobacco, firearms, and explosives under the \"Gun Control Act of 1968,\" 82 Stat. 1213, 18 U.S.C. 921(a)(3), but that is found by the bureau not to be regulated under the \"National Firearms Act,\" 68A Stat. 725 (1934), 26 U.S.C. 5845(a)."
